From f505a3a6403f2061c16e20bb756dfe9a3c9c4488 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MUHAMMAD ALIF DANIEL BIN MOHD HAIRUL HEZZELIN
 <alifdaniel.personalspace@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:02:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] pal: Feed calibration and battery info to the FourSemi
 speaker protection

Stock piano PAL sends the factory speaker resistance (RE25) from
fsalgo_rdc.bin and, while the speaker plays, the battery voltage and
temperature (BSG) to the FourSemi module in the DSP. Without them the
module protects the speakers with default values.

Do the same from a small worker started and stopped with the speaker
device on piano.
---
