 device/src/FourSemiMonitor.cpp | 357 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 439 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 device/inc/FourSemiMonitor.h
 create mode 100644 device/src/FourSemiMonitor.cpp

